{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50897","headline":"下地日侍陆侍郎御讌赋得落花（「下地日」，疑应作「下第日」。） · 王贞白","name":"下地日侍陆侍郎御讌赋得落花（「下地日」，疑应作「下第日」。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处足落花，漂泥与藉沙。\n春深上林苑，日晚五侯家。\n遍地轻难扫，当风势易斜。\n无心媿蜂蝶，来岁即荣华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}